        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__["ɵɵtext"](12, " The Scorecard is a tool designed to assess the performance of closed purchase orders in your ERP system, helping you evaluate key procurement metrics such as On-Time Delivery (OTD), Non-Conforming Material (NCR), Purchase Price Variance (PPV), and Lead Time Accuracy (LTA). By reviewing past performance, the Scorecard allows you to identify potential issues, take proactive actions to prevent them, and make informed decisions to improve future procurement performance. The goal of the Scorecard is to provide valuable insights that help prevent recurring problems, refine procurement processes, and ensure better decision-making for future purchasing activities. ");
