        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__["ɵɵtext"](17, " To get started with the Scorecard, the first step is to assign an Administrator to manage the system. The Administrator is responsible for overseeing the routine uploading of raw data and configuring KPI parameters. Specifically, the Administrator's responsibilities include: ");
