        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__["ɵɵelementStart"](257, "p", 15);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__["ɵɵtext"](258, " You can also create a line chart for a specific vendor to compare their performance against their target and the average performance. This comparison helps you understand how far the vendor is from meeting their target and provides a basis for formulating strategies to improve their performance. This feature is particularly useful for communication with vendors, as it provides clear, data-driven insights to discuss improvements. ");
