        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__["ɵɵelementStart"](275, "p", 15);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__["ɵɵtext"](276, " Within the OTD, NCR, PPV, and LTA sections, you can set the desired percentages and corresponding scores for each metric. For example, if On-Time Delivery (OTD) is a key priority for your business, you can assign a high score only if vendors meet a 99% on-time delivery rate. Alternatively, if Price Variance (PPV) is more important, you may decide to withhold full scores unless vendors meet a certain price threshold, such as a -10% variance. These settings offer you the flexibility to modify percentages and scores as needed to reflect your priorities. ");
