        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__["ɵɵtext"](13, " ScoreUs is a comprehensive Software as a Service (SaaS) solution designed to optimize procurement management across multiple stakeholders, including buyers, vendors, plants, commodities, and materials. It offers an integrated suite of products such as ScoreCard, PO Manager, and Complete, to help organizations monitor and manage both open and closed purchase orders effectively. The ScoreCard product tracks key procurement metrics such as On-Time Delivery (OTD), Non-Conformance Rate (NCR), Price Variance (PPV), and Lead Time Accuracy (LTA), while PO Manager focuses on expediting and analyzing open purchase orders, including those that are past due, requiring acknowledgement, or at risk of future delays. ");
